$ mql vault
Manage vault environments

Usage:
  mql vault [command]

Available Commands:
  add-secret  Store a secret in a vault
  configure   Configure a vault environment

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for vault

Global Flags:
      --api-proxy string   Set the proxy for communications with Mondoo Platform API
      --auto-update        Enable automatic updates of mql and its providers; overrides auto_update in the config file (default true)
      --config string      Set config file path (default $HOME/.config/mondoo/mondoo.yml)
      --log-level string   Set the log level: error, warn, info, debug, trace (default "info")
      --strict             Require every link in an MQL chain to resolve; mark optional links with a question mark
  -v, --verbose            Enable verbose output

Use "mql vault [command] --help" for more information about a command.
